      "description": "Top Logins for IDP. Use the Environment and Identity Provider variables to see different results. If there is no data in response, that indicates no logins have been made for that IDP in the timeframe. Note that this shows logins through the standard realm. If a custom realm is using a standard client to setup their IDP that will be reflected here. If there are fewer than 10 clients with login events for the selected IDP only the top clients with events are shown",
